WEBVTT

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:09.320
Demands most magnificent achievement in the conquest of space.

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:12.200
The man-made planetoid Space Academy.

00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:15.390
Founded in the star year 3732.

00:00:28.730 --> 00:00:29.970
Gathered young people.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.200
from the farthest reaches of all the known worlds.

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:34.780
They have been chosen for their unique abilities

00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:37.260
and are being trained to cope with the mysterious,

00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:40.230
the unknown, the unpredictable dangers

00:00:40.230 --> 00:00:43.030
lurking in the vast darkness of space.

00:01:09.820 --> 00:01:10.280
Commander?

00:01:10.740 --> 00:01:11.040
Yes?

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:12.380
Thank you, people.

00:01:13.590 --> 00:01:14.410
