00:01:14.930 --> 00:01:15.670
Negative, Commander.

00:01:16.130 --> 00:01:17.930
All recording systems copy, please.

00:01:18.110 --> 00:01:18.330
Oracle.

00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:19.600
Commander?

00:01:22.130 --> 00:01:22.470
Commander.

00:01:22.930 --> 00:01:25.150
Chris, have you ever seen a ghost?

00:01:25.550 --> 00:01:26.270
Oh, Commander.

00:01:26.410 --> 00:01:26.590
Have you?

00:01:27.820 --> 00:01:28.280
No, sir.

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:29.480
