00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:33.270
20 seconds, if it's consistent with past performance.

00:01:33.890 --> 00:01:36.600
There. Quadrant 9.350.

00:01:37.100 --> 00:01:37.840
Observe, all of you.

00:01:39.590 --> 00:01:40.670
There's nothing there.

00:01:41.060 --> 00:01:41.640
Just observe.

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:55.270
Just seen your first goal.

00:02:12.440 --> 00:02:14.460
We've encountered many strange things here in the cosmos.

00:02:15.190 --> 00:02:17.270
But none stranger than a ghost planet.

00:02:17.740 --> 00:02:18.820
All instruments check.

00:02:19.640 --> 00:02:20.460
There was nothing there.

00:02:21.190 --> 00:02:22.410
But we saw it.

00:02:22.840 --> 00:02:23.440
A ghost.

00:02:24.090 --> 00:02:24.910
Well, we thought we did.

00:02:25.320 --> 00:02:29.980
Well, even if there are ghosts or even ghostly worlds, there's no reason to be afraid.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:31.780
I'm not so sure of that, Chris.

00:02:33.680 --> 00:02:37.060
Proteus 9b is one of the larger asteroids occupying this orbit around the sun.

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:40.960
It's highly unstable. It has become an increasing hazard to navigation.

00:02:41.860 --> 00:02:45.660
Your mission will be to set the technite charges that will demolish Proteus 9b,

00:02:45.860 --> 00:02:49.660
and also to bring back geological specimens before the asteroid is destroyed.

00:02:50.110 --> 00:02:54.820
Proteus 9b is dead center of that... that ghost planet.

00:02:55.990 --> 00:02:57.870
Exactly is a ghost, Commander.

00:02:59.280 --> 00:02:59.960
No one is really sure...

00:03:00.560 --> 00:03:05.520
We feel that it is something that one can see,

00:03:05.600 --> 00:03:09.480
but it can never be touched, because there's nothing there to touch.

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:14.930
It's said to be the spirit of someone or something that no longer exists.

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:16.240
Where'd it go stay?

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:19.220
Wherever they like, in all parts of the universe.

00:03:19.740 --> 00:03:21.360
If there are no further questions...

00:03:21.440 --> 00:03:23.740
Request permission to stay here.

00:03:24.210 --> 00:03:25.150
Request denied.

00:03:25.950 --> 00:03:28.490
Exercise caution, all of you. Good luck.

00:05:00.890 --> 00:05:01.510
Do you hear that?

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:07.670
I don't know, Loki, but there are a lot of things here that we don't understand in space.

00:05:07.890 --> 00:05:09.950
And we can't let them frighten us.

00:05:10.190 --> 00:05:13.630
That's for you to say you can run back than I...

00:05:13.940 --> 00:05:17.260
Oh, come on, people. You're not frightened, are you?

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:18.120
Not frightened.

00:05:21.630 --> 00:05:24.420
Well, then you stay in the secret.

00:05:24.660 --> 00:05:26.320
Let's go.

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:51.060
It's being unstable.

00:05:51.320 --> 00:05:52.500
All right, well, split up.

